  "slug": "scrambled-tofu",
  "name": "Scrambled Tofu",
  "recipe_type": "breakfast",
  "brief_description": "Tomatoes, green onion, and Cheddar cheese make this protein-packed tofu scramble a tasty breakfast. You're family won't miss the eggs!",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a medium skillet over medium heat, and saute green onions until tender. Stir in tomatoes with juice and mashed tofu. Season with salt, pepper, and turmeric. Reduce heat, and simmer until heated through. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese to serve."
    }
  ],
